tting); the fan in\n299-the bottom right: dodge (big button), skills (tap: at the nearest foe · drag: aim, let go to\n300-cast, back onto the button to cancel · hold: keep casting), potion, and a \"use\" button that\n301-appears when something is in reach; top right: menu and bag. Swipe messages, banners and the\n302-minimap away; tap the minimap for the big map; tap the game outside a window to close it.\n303-Graphics quality (Auto/Low/Medium/High) and auto-attack are in the touch pause menu.\n304-\n305-H (world demo): how the room you are in works (the station guide: steps, pads, live settings,\n306-uses, ask-for-it phrases, cost, the engine's code, words); outside rooms the field guide\n307-(guide_ui.rs). Stepping on a pad with a note shows the note at the bottom for a while.\n308-Fixed system layer (never rebinds): Esc pause menu · F1 tuning panel · F2 rooms (teleport) ·\n309-F3 boot diagnostics · F4 leave room · F5 reset room · F6 pause · F7 step · F8/F9 slower/faster ·\n310-F10 edit mode (sandbox) · hold Backspace rewind · F11 fullscreen · F12 screenshot.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01DtxJEsLC8ka3FgiAvpqGo3","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
