32, exclude: Option<EntityId>) -> Option<RayHit> {\ncrates/pav_core/src/world.rs:1190:        let (h, hit) = qp.cast_ray_and_get_normal(&ray, max as Real, true)?;\n//! Stealth: guards see the player within their range and view angle when nothing blocks the\n//! line of sight (crouching shortens the range). An alert meter fills while the player is seen;\n//! a full meter sends the player back to the last checkpoint. Vision cones (clipped by walls) are\n//! handed to the view.\n\nuse glam::Vec3;\nuse rapier::prelude::*;\n\nuse crate::ai::AiDef;\nuse crate::character::Posture;\nuse crate::frame::SimEvent;\nuse crate::sim::Sim;\n\n/// A guard's vision cone for drawing: apex, wall-clipped edge points, alert (0..1).\n#[derive(Clone, Debug, PartialEq)]\npub struct ConeView {\n    pub origin: Vec3,\n    pub points: Vec<Vec3>,\n    pub alert: f32,\n}\n\nconst EYE: f32 = 1.3;\n\nimpl Sim {\n    pub(crate) fn update_guards(&mut self, dt: f32, events: &mut Vec<SimEvent>) {\n        let Some(pid) = self.state.player else { return };\n        let Some(p) = self.state.entities.get(pid) else { return };\n        let Some(pch) = p.character.as_ref() else { return };\n        if pch.riding.is_some() {\n            return;\n        }\n        let low = pch.posture != Posture::Stand;\n        let target = p.pos + Vec3::Y * (pch.height() * 0.25);\n        let pbody = p.body;\n        let time = self.state.tick as f32 * dt;\n        let guards: Vec<_> = self\n            .state\n            .entities\n            .iter()\n            .filter_map(|e| match &e.ai.as_ref()?.def {\n                AiDef::Guard { range, angle, .. } => {\n                    let ch = e.character.as_ref()?;\n                    let feet = e.pos - Vec3::Y * ch.height() * 0.5;\n                    Some((e.id, feet + Vec3::Y * EYE, ch.facing, *range, *angle, e.body))\n                }\n                _ => None,\n            })\n            .collect();\n        let mut caught = None;\n        for (id, eye, facing, range, angle, body) in guards {\n            let to = target - eye;\n            let flat = Vec3::new(to.x, 0.0, to.z);\n            let reach = range * if low { 0.6 } else { 1.0 };\n            let fwd = Vec3::new(facing.sin(), 0.0, facing.cos());\n            let mut seen = flat.length() < reach && fwd.dot(flat.normalize_or(fwd)) >= (angle.to_radians() * 0.5).cos();\n            if seen {\n                // (A filter excludes one body only: the ray starts outside the guard's capsule\n                // and ignores the player's.)\n                let _ = body;\n                let mut filter = QueryFilter::default().exclude_sensors();\ncrates/pav_core/src/arpg/cmd.rs-16-/// A menu action. Item ids are `Item::id`; slots are `EquipSlot` indices.\ncrates/pav_core/src/arpg/cmd.rs-17-#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, PartialEq, Serialize, Deserialize)]\ncrates/pav_core/src/arpg/cmd.rs-18-#[serde(rename_all = \"snake_case\")]\ncrates/pav_core/src/arpg/cmd.rs:19:pub enum GameCmd {\ncrates/pav_core/src/arpg/cmd.rs-20-    /// Pick up a ground item (clicked label).\ncrates/pav_core/src/arpg/cmd.rs-21-    Pickup(u32),\ncrates/pav_core/src/arpg/cmd.rs-22-    /// Wear a bag item (in its usual slot, or a given one).\ncrates/pav_core/src/arpg/cmd.rs-23-    Equip(u32),\ncrates/pav_core/src/arpg/cmd.rs-24-    EquipTo(u32, u8),\ncrates/pav_core/src/arpg/cmd.rs-25-    Unequip(u8),\ncrates/pav_core/src/arpg/cmd.rs-26-    /// Throw a bag item on the ground.\ncrates/pav_core/src/arpg/cmd.rs-27-    Drop(u32),\ncrates/pav_core/src/arpg/cmd.rs-28-    /// Vendor: sell a bag item, buy a vendor item, sell every bag item up to a rarity.\ncrates/pav_core/src/arpg/cmd.rs-29-    Sell(u32),\n222:    pub fn new(scene: &str, seed: u64) -> Result<Self> {\n231:    pub fn reset(&mut self) -> Result<()> {\n259:    pub fn spawn(&mut self, s: Spawn) -> EntityId {\n381:    pub fn spawn_npc(\n412:    pub fn spawn_player(&mut self) -> EntityId {\n420:    pub fn feet(&self, id: EntityId) -> Option<Vec3> {\n432: