ring> size=<array> pos=<array> color=<string> body=<string> name=<string>\n  despawn    Remove an entity.  id=<integer>\n  teleport   Move an entity (default: the player; for characters pos = feet).  id=<integer> pos=<array>\n  rewind     Go back in time: ticks=N back, or to tick=T. Starts a new timeline.  ticks=<integer> tick=<integer>\n  snapshot_save Save the full state to a file.  path=<string>\n  snapshot_load Load a state file.  path=<string>\n  record_save Save the inputs since the scene started as a replay file (JSON).  path=<string>\n  rooms      List rooms in the world (key, name, wing, bounds, entrance).  \n  room       Info card of a room (default: the one the player is in).  key=<string>\n  guide      The field guide: words the station guides use (term=, search=), or every room's ask-for-it phrases (asks=true).  term=<string> search=<string> asks=<boolean>\n  goto       Teleport the player into a room (room=key), to the plaza (room=hub) or to a position.  room=<string> pos=<array>\n  room_reset Rebuild a room from its definition (default: current room).  key=<string>\n  room_check Validate a room file without loading it. Returns errors with line/column.  path=<string>\n  room_reload Re-read room files from the rooms directory and rebuild changed rooms (hot reload).  \n  stream     Streaming state: active/dormant regions. point=[x,y,z] adds an interest point, clear=true removes them.  point=<array> clear=<boolean>\n  filmstrip  Capture N frames, `every` ticks apart (optionally driving the player), tiled into one PNG.  frames=<integer> every=<integer> columns=<integer> width=<integer> height=<integer> move=<array> hold=<string> press=<string> out=<string>\n  camera_bench Render the current moment from several camera setups, tiled into one PNG.  presets=<string> columns=<integer> width=<integer> height=<integer> out=<string>\n  npcs       Non-player characters and creatures: body plan, feet, velocity, brain, steps taken, flinch.  name=<string>\n  signal   