{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjCzAmzfTkHXJEdtM6Wq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The plan holds together. I'll apply the last fixes from that read-through: a damage threshold that stopped a .38 leg shot from ever triggering kneel, some wording, and a few precision notes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13773,"cache_read_input_tokens":591230,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":13773},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"501e7141-3737-4a8e-9cac-eb3584714d8d","uuid":"8056ad61-ad83-43c1-bd59-40c91f83f50e","timestamp":"2026-11-05T05:12:36.761Z","request_id":"req_011CgjCzAVNioYExz7dwgHro"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjCzAmzfTkHXJEdtM6Wq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Y4ooXy9T75FCk2UwJEU1dH","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='PLAN.md'; s=open(p).read()\ndef rep(a,b):\n    global s\n    assert a in s, a[:80]\n    s=s.replace(a,b,1)\nrep('''- **Paths** are relative to your dev folder. `engine/` is the engine clone inside it.\n''','''- **Paths** are relative to your dev folder. `engine/` is the engine clone inside it, and paths starting `crates/`, `docs/`, `web/`, `anim/`, `scripts/` or `assets/` are inside `engine/`.\n''')\nrep('''Read this section twice. Each item cost the planner real time.\n''','''Read this section twice. Everything here is something that went wrong, or nearly did, when the planner tried it.\n''')\nrep('''**First frame can take over 14 s to show on software rendering [V].** Hub-check's \"draws its screen\" test screenshots after about 7 s''','''**First frame can take over 14 s to show on software rendering [V].** The \"draws its screen\" check in the hub's own conformance script (`scripts/hub-check.mjs` in the AI Hub repo) screenshots after about 7 s''')\nrep('''| Reaction (any hit dealing ≥ 8 cumulative in 1 s) |''','''| Reaction (hits dealing ≥ 7 cumulative in 1 s, so one .38 shot to any part is enough) |''')\nrep('''| Camera, moving | right-shoulder offset 0.42 m, arm 2.3 m, eye height 1.55 m, FOV 58° |''','''| Camera, moving | right-shoulder offset 0.42 m, arm 2.3 m, eye height 1.55 m, FOV 58° (arm, height and FOV framing looked right in a test capture [V]) |''')\nrep('''- *Phase 1:* charges along the crypt, shells off pillars. Shots at the bell spark and do nothing, except they ring it, and enough rings (6) agitate it into a slam.''','''- *Phase 1:* charges along the crypt and breaks pillars with its shell. Shots at the bell spark and do no damage, but they ring it, and 6 rings agitate it into a slam.''')\nrep('''try to **carry Mrs. Vane off** (leg shot drops her).''','''try to **carry Mrs. Vane off** (any hit on the carrier drops her).''')\nrep('''4. **Escape.** A 60 s timed run from the wharf to the pier through collapsing streets; Bram's boat, Mrs. Vane already aboard, complaining.''','''4. **Escape.** A 60 s timed run from the wharf to the pier through collapsing streets. Bram's boat is waiting with Mrs. Vane already aboard, complaining. CASS: \"How did you...\" VANE: \"I walked.\"''')\nrep('''A Settings option holds single-press QTEs for mash ones.''','''A Settings option swaps mash QTEs for a single press.''')\nrep('''  - Economy: drop rate ×, cash ×, prices ×, lamp frequency.''','''  - Economy: drop rate ×, cash ×, prices ×, treasure value ×.''')\nrep('''net loft, customs shed, harbour office, chapel front''','''net loft, customs shed, harbor office, chapel front''')\nrep('''App and tools set `rig.params = {yaw, tilt, distance, fov, height_offset: 0, follow_lag: 0}` and `rig.snap(target)` before each `builder.build`, interpolating between frames as they do for everything.''','''App and tools set `rig.params = {yaw, tilt, distance, fov, height_offset: 0, follow_lag: 0}` and `rig.snap(target)` after `rig.update` and before each `builder.build`, interpolating between the two latest frames (`CameraParams::lerp` already takes yaw the short way round).''')\nrep('''Grep the deliverable's page and `engine/` output for audio file extensions: none shipped.''','''Also check that your additions contain no `.wav`, `.mp3` or `.ogg`, and the deliverable no `data:audio`.''')\nrep('''Serve the deliverable beside `harness.html`, `bridge.js`, `round.js` on `python3 -u -m http.server 0 --bind 127.0.0.1`, under a name you control.''','''Copy the deliverable under a simple name beside `harness.html`, `bridge.js` and `round.js`, and serve that folder with `python3 -u -m http.server 0 --bind 127.0.0.1`.''')\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ngrep -n -i \"harbour\" PLAN.md | head -3; wc -w PLAN.md","description":"Apply final review fixes to the plan"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13773,"cache_read_input_tokens":591230,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":13773},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"501e7141-3737-4a8e-9cac-eb3584714d8d","uuid":"98125e6b-1a91-48a4-b47a-1d9cff6ad998","timestamp":"2026-11-05T05:12:49.562Z","request_id":"req_011CgjCzAVNioYExz7dwgHro","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01Y4ooXy9T75FCk2UwJEU1dH":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan-v2__20261104-211956__x710a06/work && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='PLAN.md'; s=open(p).read()\ndef rep(a,b):\n    global s\n    assert a in s, a[:80]\n    s=s.replace(a,b,1)\nrep('''- **Paths** are relative to your dev folder. `engine/` is the engine clone inside it.\n''','''- **Paths** are relative to your dev folder. `engine/` is the engine clone inside it, and paths starting `crates/`, `docs/`, `web/`, `anim/`, `scripts/` or `assets/` are inside `engine/`.\n''')\nrep('''Read this section twice. Each item cost the planner real time.\n''','''Read this section twice. Everything here is something that went wrong, or nearly did, when the planner tried it.\n''')\nrep('''**First frame can take over 14 s to show on software rendering [V].** Hub-check's \"draws its screen\" test screenshots after about 7 s''','''**First frame can take over 14 s to show on software rendering [V].** The \"draws its screen\" check in the hub's own conformance script (`scripts/hub-check.mjs` in the AI Hub repo) screenshots after about 7 s''')\nrep('''| Reaction (any hit dealing ≥ 8 cumulative in 1 s) |''','''| Reaction (hits dealing ≥ 7 cumulative in 1 s, so one .38 shot to any part is enough) |''')\nrep('''| Camera, moving | right-shoulder offset 0.42 m, arm 2.3 m, eye height 1.55 m, FOV 58° |''','''| Camera, moving | right-shoulder offset 0.42 m, arm 2.3 m, eye height 1.55 m, FOV 58° (arm, height and FOV framing looked right in a test capture [V]) |''')\nrep('''- *Phase 1:* charges along the crypt, shells off pillars. Shots at the bell spark and do nothing, except they ring it, and enough rings (6) agitate it into a slam.''','''- *Phase 1:* charges along the crypt and breaks pillars with its shell. Shots at the bell spark and do no damage, but they ring it, and 6 rings agitate it into a slam.''')\nrep('''try to **carry Mrs. Vane off** (leg shot drops her).''','''try to **carry Mrs. Vane off** (any hit on the carrier drops her).''')\nrep('''4. **Escape.** A 60 s timed run from the wharf to the pier through collapsing streets; Bram's boat, Mrs. Vane already aboard, complaining.''','''4. **Escape.** A 60 s timed run from the wharf to the pier through collapsing streets. Bram's boat is waiting with Mrs. Vane already aboard, complaining. CASS: \"How did you...\" VANE: \"I walked.\"''')\nrep('''A Settings option holds single-press QTEs for mash ones.''','''A Settings option swaps mash QTEs for a single press.''')\nrep('''  - Economy: drop rate ×, cash ×, prices ×, lamp frequency.''','''  - Economy: drop rate ×, cash ×, prices ×, treasure value ×.''')\nrep('''net loft, customs shed, harbour office, chapel front''','''net loft, customs shed, harbor office, chapel front''')\nrep('''App and tools set `rig.params = {yaw, tilt, distance, fov, height_offset: 0, follow_lag: 0}` and `rig.snap(target)` before each `builder.build`, interpolating between frames as they do for everything.''','''App and tools set `rig.params = {yaw, tilt, distance, fov, height_offset: 0, follow_lag: 0}` and `rig.snap(target)` after `rig.update` and before each `builder.build`, interpolating between the two latest frames (`CameraParams::lerp` already takes yaw the short way round).''')\nrep('''Grep the deliverable's page and `engine/` output for audio file extensions: none shipped.''','''Also check that your additions contain no `.wav`, `.mp3` or `.ogg`, and the deliverable no `data:audio`.''')\nrep('''Serve the deliverable beside `harness.html`, `bridge.js`, `round.js` on `python3 -u -m http.server 0 --bind 127.0.0.1`, under a name you control.''','''Copy the deliverable under a simple name beside `harness.html`, `bridge.js` and `round.js`, and serve that folder with `python3 -u -m http.server 0 --bind 127.0.0.1`.''')\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ngrep -n -i \"harbour\" PLAN.md | head -3; wc -w PLAN.md","description":"Apply final review fixes to the plan"}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_01Y4ooXy9T75FCk2UwJEU1dH":{"cwd":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan-v2__20261104-211956__x710a06/work"}}}
